      "start": "00:04:22.140",
      "end": "00:04:26.790",
      "text": "I would note to committee members"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": "00:04:26.790",
      "end": "00:04:31.520",
      "text": "that this is really just advice or suggestion,"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "start": "00:04:31.520",
      "end": "00:04:33.550",
      "text": "a friendly suggestion that we will be giving"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "start": "00:04:33.550",
      "end": "00:04:37.410",
      "text": "to the next council that takes office on November 14th."
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "start": "00:04:37.410",
      "end": "00:04:40.910",
      "text": "We are lame duck, unfortunately,"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "start": "00:04:40.910",
      "end": "00:04:46.870",
      "text": "and so we can't direct this funding as of now."
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "start": "00:04:46.870",
      "end": "00:04:49.410",
      "text": "It's not technically budgeted money."
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "start": "00:04:49.410",
      "end": "00:04:51.680",
      "text": "It was sort of earmarked and set aside,"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "start": "00:04:51.680",
      "end": "00:04:53.780",
      "text": "but not budgeted per se."
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "start": "00:04:53.780",
      "end": "00:04:56.240",
      "text": "So this will be a decision that will be made"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "start": "00:04:56.240",
      "end": "00:05:01.630",
      "text": "by the council of the day, starting November 14th."
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "start": "00:05:01.630",
      "end": "00:05:05.190",
      "text": "However, it gives staff an indication as well"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "start": "00:05:05.190",
      "end": "00:05:07.220",
      "text": "of the direction that we're suggesting."
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "start": "00:05:07.220",
      "end": "00:05:10.670",
      "text": "And in the past, business cases came forward"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "start": "00:05:10.670",
      "end": "00:05:13.330",
      "text": "to us directly from different organizations,"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "start": "00:05:13.330",
      "end": "00:05:17.400",
      "text": "whereas the direction here is that city staff actively work"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "start": "00:05:17.400",
      "end": "00:05:19.060",
      "text": "with community organizations."
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "start": "00:05:19.060",
      "end": "00:05:22.550",
      "text": "And as we saw, you know, what's happened recently"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "start": "00:05:22.550",
      "end": "00:05:25.800",
      "text": "with the hunger strike and things that took place"
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "start": "00:05:25.800",
      "end": "00:05:31.150",
      "text": "in the city, things work better when groups' organizations"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "start": "00:05:31.150",
      "end": "00:05:32.860",
      "text": "come together and work together."
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "start": "00:05:32.860",
      "end": "00:05:36.080",
      "text": "So this is the spirit of this direction,"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "start": "00:05:36.080",
      "end": "00:05:39.260",
      "text": "that civic administration work directly with the community."
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "start": "00:05:39.260",
      "end": "00:05:41.800",
      "text": "So they come forward with collaborative"
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "start": "00:05:41.800",
      "end": "00:05:44.670",
      "text": "and cooperative approaches to how can we address"
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "start": "00:05:44.670",
      "end": "00:05:47.050",
      "text": "some of the problems that London's facing."
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "start": "00:05:47.050",
      "end": "00:05:47.950",
      "text": "Thanks very much."
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "start": "00:05:47.950",
      "end": "00:05:49.730",
      "text": "I think you've articulated that clearly"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "start": "00:05:49.730",
      "end": "00:05:52.140",
      "text": "that this is not incumbent."
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "start": "00:05:52.140",
      "end": "00:05:54.120",
      "text": "In fact, we do not have the authorities of council"
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "start": "00:05:54.120",
      "end": "00:05:57.660",
      "text": "to provide direction on the remaining funds,"
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "start": "00:05:57.660",
      "end": "00:06:00.320",
      "text": "but certainly it would be up to the following council"
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "start": "00:06:00.320",
      "end": "00:06:02.100",
      "text": "to do so."
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "start": "00:06:02.100",
      "end": "00:06:04.120",
      "text": "So with that, any other comments or questions?"
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "start": "00:06:04.120",
      "end": "00:06:09.770",
      "text": "This has been duly moved and seconded."
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "start": "00:06:09.770",
      "end": "00:06:36.200",
      "text": "I see none, so with that, we will call the question."
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "start": "00:06:36.200",
      "end": "00:06:40.570",
      "text": "Councillor Sallie, Councillor Palosa."
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "start": "00:06:40.570",
      "end": "00:06:42.400",
      "text": "Emmanuel Yay."
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "start": "00:06:42.400",
      "end": "00:06:44.460",
      "text": "Emmanuel Yay as well, mine didn't come out."
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "start": "00:06:44.460",
      "end": "00:06:47.220",
      "text": "Thank you both."
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "start": "00:06:47.220",
      "end": "00:06:50.750",
      "text": "Opposing the vote, the motion's passed, 15 to zero."
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "start": "00:06:50.750",
      "end": "00:06:52.980",
      "text": "Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "start": "00:06:52.980",
      "end": "00:06:55.400",
      "text": "Edward matters nor additional business."
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "start": "00:06:55.400",
      "end": "00:06:56.650",
      "text": "Our colleague says this is our way"
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "start": "00:06:56.650",
      "end": "00:07:00.460",
      "text": "when we have all council together."
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "start": "00:07:00.460",
      "end": "00:07:02.900",
      "text": "This gives me an opportunity to say thank you to staff"
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "start": "00:07:02.900",
      "end": "00:07:06.570",
      "text": "for the work that they continue to do,"
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "start": "00:07:06.570",
      "end": "00:07:07.480",
      "text": "particularly over this summer,"
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "start": "00:07:07.480",
      "end": "00:07:10.370",
      "text": "I would like to ask Ms. Livingston to pass on"
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "start": "00:07:10.370",
      "end": "00:07:13.890",
      "text": "to senior staff who I know of at our request"
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "start": "00:07:13.890",
      "end": "00:07:18.910",
      "text": "to pass on to their staffs, our sincere appreciation."
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "start": "00:07:18.910",
      "end": "00:07:21.400",
      "text": "And a particular shout out for the most recent event"
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "start": "00:07:21.400",
      "end": "00:07:23.290",
      "text": "we had with regard to the United Way."
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "start": "00:07:23.290",
      "end": "00:07:28.810",
      "text": "As encouraging as it was to be asked to participate,"
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "start": "00:07:28.810",
      "end": "00:07:32.970",
      "text": "both in singing with the group for United Way Fundraiser,"
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "start": "00:07:32.970",
      "end": "00:07:36.010",
      "text": "that's a lie, they did not ask me, so they do a wisdom."
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "start": "00:07:36.010",
      "end": "00:07:39.840",
      "text": "And the second part of that was that the tractor pole,"
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "start": "00:07:39.840",
      "end": "00:07:44.370",
      "text": "which was really a fire truck and a large tanker truck."
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "start": "00:07:44.370",
      "end": "00:07:47.050",
      "text": "And I was not asked to participate on that as well."
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "start": "00:07:47.050",
      "end": "00:07:48.160",
      "text": "Again, wisdom prevailed."
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "start": "00:07:48.160",
      "end": "00:07:51.210",
      "text": "But I thought it showed great spirit."
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "start": "00:07:51.210",
      "end": "00:07:54.220",
      "text": "And this was at the A.J. Tyler yard works."
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "start": "00:07:54.220",
      "end": "00:07:58.530",
      "text": "And again, for everyone who participated,"
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "start": "00:07:58.530",
      "end": "00:08:00.000",
      "text": "thank you for supporting the United Way."
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "start": "00:08:00.000",
      "end": "00:08:02.420",
      "text": "There'll be more opportunities to do that in the future."
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "start": "00:08:02.420",
      "end": "00:08:03.730",
      "text": "But to staff, thank you very much"
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "start": "00:08:03.730",
      "end": "00:08:05.550",
      "text": "for all your involvement in that."
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "start": "00:08:05.550",
      "end": "00:08:10.450",
      "text": "And a special shout out to Jack Davis and our MC"
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "start": "00:08:10.450",
      "end": "00:08:14.230",
      "text": "and she kept things going and did the countdown"
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "start": "00:08:14.230",
      "end": "00:08:16.590",
      "text": "and was quite eloquent, actually."
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "start": "00:08:16.590",
      "end": "00:08:18.630",
      "text": "So it was a lot of good fun and we appreciated it."
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "start": "00:08:18.630",
      "end": "00:08:22.530",
      "text": "So with that, let's look for a motion to adjourn."
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "start": "00:08:22.530",
      "end": "00:08:23.600",
      "text": "No one wants to leave."
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "start": "00:08:23.600",
      "end": "00:08:24.420",
      "text": "This is nice."
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "start": "00:08:24.420",
      "end": "00:08:27.100",
      "text": "I see Councillor Hopkins seconded by Councillor Hillier."
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "start": "00:08:27.100",
      "end": "00:08:30.990",
      "text": "With that, can we do a show of hands, Clerk?"
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "start": "00:08:30.990",
      "end": "00:08:37.650",
      "text": "So we need you to shine, we need to raise your hand, please."
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "start": "00:08:37.650",
      "end": "00:08:38.630",
      "text": "That motion's carried."
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "start": "00:08:38.630",
      "end": "00:08:39.700",
      "text": "Thanks very much, colleagues."
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "start": "00:08:39.700",
      "end": "00:08:40.520",
      "text": "Meeting is adjourned."
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "start": "00:08:40.520",
      "end": "00:08:44.740",
      "text": "We will see you at the next committee meetings"
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "start": "00:08:44.740",
      "end": "00:08:45.630",
      "text": "council before."
    }
  ],
  "transcript_source": "lillian_skinner_archive",
  "transcript_source_url": "https://london.lillianskinner.ca/Meetings/Strategic%20Priorities%20and%20Policy%20Committee/2022/08-30/.transcript.srt"
}